# =============================================================================
# .dockerignore — build-context exclusions for the W5Base application image
# (NET-NEW, additive companion to the root Dockerfile).
#
# WHY this file exists:
#   The Dockerfile uses `COPY . ${W5BASEINSTDIR}` to place the W5Base source
#   tree into the image. Without these exclusions the copy would (a) drag the
#   out-of-scope contrib/ tree into the image, (b) risk baking a local secrets
#   file into a layer, and (c) bloat the image with large binary docs and the
#   .git history. Excluding them here is the standard, secure way to keep the
#   image lean and to satisfy the Dockerfile's validation guarantees
#   ("image does NOT include contrib/" and "no secrets baked into any layer").
#
# What is intentionally KEPT (do NOT add these): docker/ (entrypoint + config
# templates consumed at runtime), dependence/ (vendored Perl modules compiled
# at build time), and the application tree (bin/ lib/ mod/ sbin/ sql/ etc/
# skin/ static/) — the static/ and skin/ assets are required for the main
# menu to render.
# =============================================================================

# --- Version-control metadata (never needed inside the image) ----------------
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes

# --- OUT OF SCOPE: the contributed OracleLinux container and any other contrib
#     assets must never be copied into this Debian/prefork/mod_perl2 image. -----
contrib/

# --- Secrets: real environment files must never enter an image layer.
#     (.env.example carries only placeholders and is harmless, but is not
#      needed at runtime, so it is excluded too.) --------------------------------
.env
.env.*

# --- Large binary documentation (handbook) — excluded via .blitzyignore too. -
*.odt
*.pdf

# --- Build-orchestration / CI artifacts that are not part of the app runtime -
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
docker-compose.yml
docker-compose.*.yml
.github/

# --- Blitzy tooling / local scratch — not part of the application ------------
blitzy/
blitzy_adhoc_test_*

# --- Common local cruft ------------------------------------------------------
**/*.swp
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
